          "For every completed visit booked through Gloumi you earn Gloumi points – one for each whole euro you paid for that visit in the app (by card, Apple Pay or another method offered in the app), including a deposit. No points are given for the part paid with the gift card balance, a coupon or credit, for amounts paid on site or for tips. Points are added when the visit is marked as done; there are no points for cancelled visits or visits that did not take place. You also earn points for invitations (see “Invitations and gift cards”).",
          "Once you have 500 points, you can exchange them for a €5 coupon – in the app, tap “Exchange 500 points for a €5 coupon”. You can exchange each time you have at least 500 points; exchanged points cannot be restored. A coupon is valid for 12 months from the exchange; we let you know in the app about 30 days before a coupon expires. A coupon can be used only for a visit you pay for in the app; only one coupon can be used per visit, and it cannot be combined with another coupon or with the gift card balance. If the visit costs less than €5, the difference is not kept. As with the gift card balance, a coupon cannot pay the last €0.50 of the visit price – you pay that by card or another method offered in the app. If the visit is cancelled or declined by the master, or you get your money back for a visit that did not happen, the coupon used for it returns to your account with the same expiry date (if that date has already passed, the coupon is no longer valid). If you do not come without cancelling, the coupon is not returned.",
